              "output": "```yaml\nkernelspec:\n  display_name: R\n  language: R\n  name: ir\nlanguage_info:\n  codemirror_mode: r\n  file_extension: .r\n  mimetype: text/x-r-source\n  name: R\n  pygments_lexer: r\n  version: 4.2.3\n```\n\n### Cell 0\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 2e295ffb-f46d-4541-bfa3-0c8592d10cec\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\nlibrary('tidymodels')\nlibrary('palmerpenguins')\nlibrary('vip')\n\ntheme_set(theme_gray(base_size = 16))```\n\n### Cell 1\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 580b458d-3ab3-4c6c-b434-697e8da959ff\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\npenguins2 = penguins |>\n    drop_na()\n\npenguins2 |> head()```\n\n### Cell 2\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 48287b29-a145-491f-9985-784a4146d8d3\ntags: []\ntype: markdown\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```\n## Use random forests to model `bill_length_mm````\n\n### Cell 3\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 19936f5e-908e-4670-987f-9200be24eaca\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\nmod = rand_forest() |> \n    set_engine('ranger', importance = 'impurity') |>\n    set_mode('regression')```\n\n### Cell 4\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 955f855b-9811-4e05-8fb9-5ee8e78035a5\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\nrec = recipe(bill_length_mm ~ ., data = penguins2) |>\n    step_rm(year) |>\n    step_dummy(sex, island, species) |>\n    prep(retain = TRUE)\n\nrec |> juice() |> head()```\n\n### Cell 5\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: ebda8a9a-08f7-4278-90c0-470c13ed6759\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\nwf = workflow() |> \n  add_recipe(rec) |> \n  add_model(mod)\n\nwf_fit = wf |> fit(data = penguins2)\n\nwf_fit```\n\n### Cell 6\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 7afebedb-cbd3-432f-a644-c2f2dfe2e861\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\noutcomes = augment(wf_fit |> extract_fit_parsnip(), \n                   new_data = rec |> juice())\n\noutcomes |> head()```\n\n### Cell 7\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 296af724-1ac5-4fed-8182-c72818d80e04\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\noptions(repr.plot.width = 6, repr.plot.height = 5)\n\nggplot(outcomes) +\n    geom_point(aes(x = bill_depth_mm, y = bill_length_mm)) + \n    geom_point(aes(x = bill_depth_mm, y = .pred), color = 'steelblue', size = 3,\n               alpha = 0.5) +\n    geom_segment(aes(x = bill_depth_mm, xend = bill_depth_mm, y = .pred, yend = bill_length_mm), \n                 color = 'firebrick',\n                 alpha = 0.25)```\n\n### Cell 8\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: fb160ad1-7ca3-4cb1-84ed-ffbaa7f2acee\ntype: markdown\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```\n## Visualize feature importance```\n\n### Cell 9\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nid: 775b0c9a-ba8f-41c8-bcd0-fce4fadc4dec\ntags: []\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\noptions(repr.plot.width = 6, repr.plot.height = 4)\n\nwf_fit |> \n  extract_fit_parsnip() |> \n  vip()```"
            },
